name: Gros Michel — mult with a fuse
author: corpus
description: >-
  Gros Michel gives +15 Mult, with a 1 in 6 chance to be destroyed at end of round.
  First-shop burst mult; once it dies it unlocks Cavendish (X3 Mult). Oops! All 6s
  doubles the destroy odds to intentionally roll into Cavendish faster.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: GrosMichel
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Cavendish
    antes: [2, 3, 4]
    score: 40
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
